This product builds on top of OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. nextclaw integrates with
OpenClaw via its public Plugin SDK and re-uses the following interfaces and
helpers from OpenClaw:

  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/memory-core-host-runtime-core (MemoryPluginRuntime,
    MemoryPromptSectionBuilder)
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/memory-core-host-engine-storage (MemorySearchManager)
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/memory-core-host-engine-embeddings
    (MemoryEmbeddingProviderAdapter)
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/plugin-entry (definePluginEntry, OpenClawPluginApi)
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/agent-runtime
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/runtime-env
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/config-types
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/session-store-runtime
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/temp-path
  - openclaw/plugin-sdk/routing

